Package: cdiffsurveillance
Type: Compendium
Title: Reproducible Descriptive Surveillance of C. difficile Infection in England
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Payton", "Yau", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3283-0370"))
Description: A research compendium (not an installable package) that downloads UKHSA monthly
    mandatory C. difficile surveillance files, harmonises several spreadsheet layouts into one
    tidy dataset with automated quality checks, and produces descriptive, seasonal,
    exceedance and data-revision analyses with a rendered report.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
